        <footnote id="F1">The Brink's Company (&quot;BCO&quot;) withheld shares of common stock to satisfy the tax withholding obligation for the Reporting Person's Restricted Stock Units (&quot;RSUs&quot;) that vested on March 1, 2026.</footnote>
